flowchart TB
accTitle: Fanout preserves every processor's work while queues bound pressure
accDescr: An SNS topic copies each photo notification into separate processor queues. Each queue feeds a bounded Lambda consumer, and both consumers reuse database connections through RDS Proxy before writing to one RDS database.
S[S3 photo notification]:::inputData --> N[SNS topic<br/>Copy event to each subscriber]:::process
N --> A[(Processor A queue)]:::storage
N --> B[(Processor B queue)]:::storage
A --> LA[Lambda A<br/>Bounded concurrency]:::process
B --> LB[Lambda B<br/>Bounded concurrency]:::process
LA --> P[RDS Proxy<br/>Reuse backend connections]:::process
LB --> P
P --> D[(RDS MySQL writer)]:::storage
